Package: power4
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Jim Studt <jim@studt.net>
Depends: libc6, libedit2, libswiftlang (>= 6.0.3), libswiftlang (<< 6.0.4~)
Provides: power4ctl
Conflicts: power4ctl
Replaces: power4ctl
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Host tools for power4 controllers
 Installs power4ctl, the serial and authenticated TCP management client, and
 power4d, a multi-node report collector for serial and authenticated TCP
 controllers. The power4d systemd service keeps node-specific JSON state
 reports current for local consumers. Complete flash images for both supported
 controller boards are also included.
